{"3865690": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Hyper Vyper", "steam_appid": 3865690, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BRING THE FIGHT TO THEM</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>They sent an army.  You brought spite and caffeine.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They’ve come for your games.  Your fun.  Your freedom.  Now they’re coming for<i> you.</i>  <br><br>Hyper Vyper is a kinetic third-person roguelite shooter  tracing the arc from Resistance to Revolution.  You and your people have had enough of The Authority pressing in on your lives.  Like, enough of this shit - right? Also: they’re coming for that ass so you don’t have much choice.  Go break their shit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865690/extras/30760bc482cf0dcbf4027aa46f8871b4.poster.avif?t=1784504537\" width=1170 height=604 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865690/extras/30760bc482cf0dcbf4027aa46f8871b4.webm?t=1784504537\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865690/extras/30760bc482cf0dcbf4027aa46f8871b4.mp4?t=1784504537\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br>Don’t be intimidated!  Looking scary is like their whole thing.  Watch what happens when you get behind the wheel, forreal.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865690/extras/b4fde6ed7b520ce23ec578aa5016aa7e.poster.avif?t=1784504537\" width=1170 height=478 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865690/extras/b4fde6ed7b520ce23ec578aa5016aa7e.webm?t=1784504537\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865690/extras/b4fde6ed7b520ce23ec578aa5016aa7e.mp4?t=1784504537\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BUILD YOURSELF FROM (ALMOST) SCRATCH</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You’re dropped into the world as the character of your choice - what you become from there is entirely up to you. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865690/extras/da59a629dc8d74a2f1c5056bc7353ab3.poster.avif?t=1784504537\" width=1170 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865690/extras/da59a629dc8d74a2f1c5056bc7353ab3.webm?t=1784504537\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865690/extras/da59a629dc8d74a2f1c5056bc7353ab3.mp4?t=1784504537\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everyone has some smooth movement - what’s the version that speaks to you?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865690/extras/5b21e9de541d70b35de27f02c659980b.poster.avif?t=1784504537\" width=1170 height=478 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865690/extras/5b21e9de541d70b35de27f02c659980b.webm?t=1784504537\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865690/extras/5b21e9de541d70b35de27f02c659980b.mp4?t=1784504537\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What is the shape of your Resistance? Do you fight with your mind?  Your reflexes?  Your heart? Discover, choose, experiment.  Test assumptions, find new paths, honor old ways.  There’s more than meets the eye - dumbass ideas explicitly encouraged.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BRING THE FIGHT TO THEM</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>They sent an army.  You brought spite and caffeine.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >They’ve come for your games.  Your fun.  Your freedom.  Now they’re coming for<i> you.</i>  <br><br>Hyper Vyper is a kinetic third-person roguelite shooter  tracing the arc from Resistance to Revolution.  You and your people have had enough of The Authority pressing in on your lives.  Like, enough of this shit - right? Also: they’re coming for that ass so you don’t have much choice.  Go break their shit.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865690/extras/30760bc482cf0dcbf4027aa46f8871b4.poster.avif?t=1784504537\" width=1170 height=604 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865690/extras/30760bc482cf0dcbf4027aa46f8871b4.webm?t=1784504537\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865690/extras/30760bc482cf0dcbf4027aa46f8871b4.mp4?t=1784504537\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br>Don’t be intimidated!  Looking scary is like their whole thing.  Watch what happens when you get behind the wheel, forreal.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865690/extras/b4fde6ed7b520ce23ec578aa5016aa7e.poster.avif?t=1784504537\" width=1170 height=478 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865690/extras/b4fde6ed7b520ce23ec578aa5016aa7e.webm?t=1784504537\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865690/extras/b4fde6ed7b520ce23ec578aa5016aa7e.mp4?t=1784504537\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BUILD YOURSELF FROM (ALMOST) SCRATCH</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You’re dropped into the world as the character of your choice - what you become from there is entirely up to you. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865690/extras/da59a629dc8d74a2f1c5056bc7353ab3.poster.avif?t=1784504537\" width=1170 height=540 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865690/extras/da59a629dc8d74a2f1c5056bc7353ab3.webm?t=1784504537\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865690/extras/da59a629dc8d74a2f1c5056bc7353ab3.mp4?t=1784504537\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everyone has some smooth movement - what’s the version that speaks to you?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865690/extras/5b21e9de541d70b35de27f02c659980b.poster.avif?t=1784504537\" width=1170 height=478 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865690/extras/5b21e9de541d70b35de27f02c659980b.webm?t=1784504537\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865690/extras/5b21e9de541d70b35de27f02c659980b.mp4?t=1784504537\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What is the shape of your Resistance? Do you fight with your mind?  Your reflexes?  Your heart? Discover, choose, experiment.  Test assumptions, find new paths, honor old ways.  There’s more than meets the eye - dumbass ideas explicitly encouraged.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Hyper Vyper is an electric third-person roguelite shooter for those that stay moving.  Blast, kick &amp; slide through a Neon City descending into madness.  Master a kinetic moveset, find crazy builds, grow from outgunned survivor to unstoppable force. Resist!", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865690/26b18c1c1ce0823b591f8dd112414694f41d1a7e/header.jpg?t=1784504537", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865690/aaff58b72fc88096c6cc677089d84ebaeac1388a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1784504537", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3865690/aaff58b72fc88096c6cc677089d84ebaeac1388a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1784504537", "website": "https://hypervypergame.com/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 <br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-6500 / AMD Ryzen 3 1200<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX 1050 / RX 560<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 4 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> DirectX compatible</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["The Last Resistance"], "publish